# Demo 1 — trust, then see the world: doctor + filtered status.
Output demo-status.gif

Set Width 1200
Set Height 470
Set FontSize 14
Set Padding 16

Hide
Type "export PATH=$HOME/.work/bin:$PATH && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "screenz doctor"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s

Type "screenz status --match bundle=com.apple.TextEdit"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
